WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:09.152
Word Bomb is a fast, slightly stressful typing game for two to eight players, and the computer can join in if you're short on people.

2
00:00:09.852 --> 00:00:19.221
There's a bomb, and it's got a hidden fuse. When it's in your hands, you see a few letters on screen, and you have to type any real word that contains them.

3
00:00:19.371 --> 00:00:21.611
The letters can be anywhere in the word.

4
00:00:22.311 --> 00:00:29.046
If the word works, the bomb jumps to the next player with fresh letters. If it doesn't, try again, and quickly.

5
00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:32.997
Words can't be used twice, so the easy ones disappear fast.

6
00:00:33.697 --> 00:00:39.388
When the bomb explodes, whoever is holding it loses a heart. Last player standing wins.

7
00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:43.294
And everyone can see what you're typing, so there's nowhere to hide.
